# 4. First technical correction: database

Your intended architecture says PostgreSQL, but the current implementation is actually using SQLite because the configuration defaults override the intended Postgres environment. 

So:

### Development

```text
PostgreSQL
```

Use the same database engine family as production.

Don't maintain:

```text
SQLite logic
+
PostgreSQL logic
```

unless you have a specific testing reason.

### Goal

```text
Local Docker
PostgreSQL
    ↓
Staging PostgreSQL
    ↓
Production PostgreSQL
```

This eliminates database behavior drift.

